  itemUses:
  - I have nowhere to check my fit before heading out!
  - "I broke my last one, and I\u2019m afraid the seven years of bad luck are coming
    for me\u2026"
  - "I have never owned a cool new one before, and I think it\u2019s time."
  - I want to practice positive affirmations each morning. And I need a mirror for
    that!
  - I need to check for sand in my hair before guests visit..
